"The SSH command could not be copied." = "无法拷贝 SSH 命令。";
"Include passwords and private-key files" = "包含密码和私钥文件";
"Backup Password" = "备份密码";
"Confirm Backup Password" = "确认备份密码";
"Use at least 12 characters. Keep this password safe; it cannot be recovered." = "请使用至少 12 个字符。请妥善保管此密码，因为它无法找回。";
"Show password" = "显示密码";
"Hide password" = "隐藏密码";
"Encrypted backup. SSH config, agent identities and hardware keys are not included." = "加密备份。不包含 SSH 配置、代理身份和硬件密钥。";
"Includes each server’s saved password and selected private-key file. Existing encrypted keys still need their own passphrases." = "包含每台服务器已保存的密码和所选私钥文件。已加密的密钥仍需使用各自的密钥口令。";
"SSH configuration files, agent/default identities, and hardware keys are not bundled. You must resolve external dependencies on the destination Mac." = "不包含 SSH 配置文件、代理或默认身份以及硬件密钥。您必须在目标 Mac 上处理外部依赖项。";
"Passwords do not match." = "密码不一致。";
"Backup passwords must contain at least 12 characters and at most 1024 UTF-8 bytes." = "备份密码必须至少包含 12 个字符，且 UTF-8 编码后不超过 1024 字节。";
"Unlock Backup" = "解锁备份";
"Enter the password used to encrypt this backup. Nothing is restored until you review and confirm." = "请输入用于加密此备份的密码。在您检查并确认之前，不会恢复任何内容。";
"Unlock" = "解锁";
"Processing backup…" = "正在处理备份…";
"Protected backup: selected passwords go to Keychain and bundled keys are restored as private files. The encrypted source stays unchanged." = "受保护的备份：所选密码将存入钥匙串，包含的密钥将恢复为私有文件。加密的源文件保持不变。";
"Bundled Password" = "包含密码";
"Bundled Private Key" = "包含私钥";
"Choose SSH Configuration" = "选择 SSH 配置";
"SSH Configuration Required" = "需要 SSH 配置";
"Configuration Selected" = "已选择配置";
"Add as Separate Copy" = "添加为独立副本";
"Matching server: selected entries are added as separate copies, never used to update existing servers." = "存在匹配的服务器：所选条目将添加为独立副本，绝不会用于更新现有服务器。";
"Select an SSH configuration file you trust on this Mac. Its external dependencies are not copied." = "请选择此 Mac 上您信任的 SSH 配置文件。其外部依赖项不会被拷贝。";
"Choose a readable SSH configuration file." = "请选择可读取的 SSH 配置文件。";
"Backup passwords must contain at most 1024 UTF-8 bytes." = "备份密码的 UTF-8 编码不得超过 1024 字节。";
"Exporting…" = "正在导出…";
"Unlocking…" = "正在解锁…";
"Encrypted backup unlocked. Selected connections restore their bundled passwords and private keys; application settings are not changed." = "已解锁加密备份。所选连接将连同其包含的密码和私钥一起恢复；应用设置不会更改。";
"Bundled encrypted private keys remain encrypted and still require their own passphrases. Key passphrases are not stored in this backup." = "包含的加密私钥仍保持加密状态，并仍需使用各自的密钥口令。此备份不保存密钥口令。";
"Automatic SSH identities, SSH agents, default keys and hardware devices are external dependencies and are not bundled. Configure them on this Mac before connecting." = "自动 SSH 身份、SSH 代理、默认密钥和硬件设备属于外部依赖项，不包含在备份中。请在连接前在此 Mac 上配置它们。";
"SSH configuration files and their dependencies are not bundled. Choose and trust a configuration on this Mac for each marked connection before importing it." = "不包含 SSH 配置文件及其依赖项。导入每个标记的连接前，请在此 Mac 上选择您信任的配置。";
"Use at least 12 characters for a new backup password, and no more than 1024 UTF-8 bytes. To unlock a backup, enter its original password without changing spaces." = "新备份密码请使用至少 12 个字符，且 UTF-8 编码后不超过 1024 字节。解锁备份时，请输入原始密码，不要更改空格。";
"Choose an absolute private-key file path before creating an encrypted backup. Relative paths cannot be backed up safely." = "创建加密备份前，请选择私钥文件的绝对路径。无法安全地备份相对路径。";
"Choose a backup destination other than a referenced private key or SSH configuration. Source files have not been changed." = "请选择与所引用的私钥或 SSH 配置不同的备份目标。源文件未更改。";
"Choose a readable regular encrypted backup file no larger than 64 MiB. Symbolic links and special files are not supported. Nothing was imported." = "请选择不超过 64 MiB 的可读取普通加密备份文件。不支持符号链接和特殊文件。未导入任何内容。";
"Every selected private key must be a readable regular OpenSSH or PEM private-key file no larger than 1 MiB. Symbolic links and unsupported keys cannot be backed up. Nothing was exported." = "每个所选私钥都必须是不超过 1 MiB 的可读取普通 OpenSSH 或 PEM 私钥文件。无法备份符号链接和不支持的密钥。未导出任何内容。";
"A saved server password is missing or could not be read from Keychain. Unlock and authorize Keychain access, or save the missing password before backing up. Nothing was exported." = "已保存的服务器密码缺失，或无法从钥匙串读取。备份前，请解锁并授权访问钥匙串，或保存缺失的密码。未导出任何内容。";
"The encrypted backup contains invalid, inconsistent or unsupported connection data. Nothing was imported or exported." = "加密备份包含无效、不一致或不支持的连接数据。未导入或导出任何内容。";
"The backup exceeds the 64 MiB encrypted-file limit or the 32 MiB combined connection, password and private-key content limit. Nothing was imported or exported." = "备份超过了加密文件的 64 MiB 限制，或连接、密码和私钥内容合计的 32 MiB 限制。未导入或导出任何内容。";
"The backup could not be unlocked. Check its password and use an intact supported encrypted backup. Nothing was imported." = "无法解锁备份。请检查密码，并使用完整且受支持的加密备份。未导入任何内容。";
"The encrypted backup could not be secured. No backup file was changed." = "无法安全地保护加密备份。未更改任何备份文件。";
"Choose an export destination other than the active library, its lock files, or a referenced private key or SSH configuration." = "请选择与当前资料库、其锁定文件以及所引用的私钥或 SSH 配置不同的导出目标。";
"The import contains duplicate server identifiers. Nothing was imported." = "导入数据包含重复的服务器标识符。未导入任何内容。";
"Choose and trust an SSH configuration for every selected server that requires one before importing." = "导入前，请为每台需要 SSH 配置的所选服务器选择您信任的 SSH 配置。";
"The bundled private key does not match the server’s authentication mode." = "包含的私钥与服务器的认证模式不匹配。";
"The bundled private key must be valid UTF-8 and no larger than 1 MiB." = "包含的私钥必须是有效的 UTF-8，且不超过 1 MiB。";
"A saved credential already uses this server identifier. Nothing was imported." = "已保存的凭据已使用此服务器标识符。未导入任何内容。";
"Import failed, and the previous Keychain state could not be restored. Review entries under %@." = "导入失败，且无法恢复钥匙串的先前状态。请检查 %@ 下的条目。";
"Import failed, and newly created private-key files could not all be removed. Review %@." = "导入失败，且无法删除所有新建的私钥文件。请检查 %@。";
"%@" = "%@";
